{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/textb1.png?t=1746100812\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/tsgif_gameplay.gif?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty Six is an action packed\u00a0bullet hell that you play through the multiverse- <strong>and experience how it was made in parallel dimensions</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/textb2.png?t=1746100812\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/tsgif_jump.gif?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dimension changes how the <strong>player</strong> and how the <strong>blocks</strong> work. However, these can be mixed, resulting in 676 different verses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: Start from <strong>AA</strong> and get to <strong>ZZ</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/verses.png?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/textb3.png?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the game is being actively developed, here's a list of the planned features!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Collectibles for each verse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-A special attack that changes as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Bosses that appear in certain verses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638060?t=1746100812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/9222d68a385bbf0f8a9d379d04fe1ffd0e182800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746100812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/1de99c794565af1a1665d7783aefd7b3c86e9e3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746100812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/1de99c794565af1a1665d7783aefd7b3c86e9e3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746100812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/textb1.png?t=1746100812\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/tsgif_gameplay.gif?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twenty Six is an action packed\u00a0bullet hell that you play through the multiverse- <strong>and experience how it was made in parallel dimensions</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/textb2.png?t=1746100812\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/tsgif_jump.gif?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each dimension changes how the <strong>player</strong> and how the <strong>blocks</strong> work. However, these can be mixed, resulting in 676 different verses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple: Start from <strong>AA</strong> and get to <strong>ZZ</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/verses.png?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/textb3.png?t=1746100812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the game is being actively developed, here's a list of the planned features!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Planned features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Collectibles for each verse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-A special attack that changes as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Bosses that appear in certain verses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["teevy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/bb42880e0798b8ccd8c5c29023397dd19931e3cd/header.jpg?t=1746100812","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131727,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131727/movie480.mp4?t=1745803492","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131727/movie_max.mp4?t=1745803492"},"name":"Twenty Six - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131727/69b8ce9f422a1229362c7c79139f0ced120463fe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745803